# Cursor Rules for AI Video Creator

See AGENTS.md for full project schema and components.

When prompted to create a video:
1. Write project JSON to `projects/<name>.json`.
2. Keep narration between 125-145 words for 9:16 Shorts to stay strictly under 60 seconds.
3. Validate with `python scripts/validate_project.py projects/<name>.json`.
4. Run `python scripts/build_video.py --input projects/<name>.json --format Shorts --upload --privacy public`.
